{"at": "2026-11-25T19:21:29.479Z", "run": "20261125-0137-verify-debrid-5636", "unit": "u157", "op": "set", "rid": "debrid/aradeb", "path": "$.egress.terms", "old": "Streams are played from the user's own Real-Debrid or TorBox account ('Streams are provided through your paid Real-Debrid or TorBox account'), so traffic is billed by that provider and not by Aradeb.", "new": "Streams are provided through the user's own paid debrid account: TorBox, AllDebrid, Premiumize or Real-Debrid. Real-Debrid support is being phased out; TorBox or AllDebrid is recommended. Traffic is billed by that provider and not by Aradeb.", "rung": "documented", "evidence": {"url": "https://stremio-addons.net/addons/aradeb", "date": "2026-11-25", "proved": "the addon now names four supported debrid providers and phases out Real-Debrid", "capture": "sha256:7959bb23c4cdabda0e6919398f3f3dbc1ec9f8c9ffd8dbf9edb0f0d26397b590", "quote": "- Discover content using **TorBox, AllDebrid, Premiumize, or Real-Debrid**.\n- Quality and availability depend on sources and your paid Debrid provider.\n\n*Note: Real-Debrid support is being phased out. TorBox or AllDebrid is recommended.*"}, "added": true, "reason": "the live listing lists four debrid providers and says Real-Debrid is being phased out, while the record names only Real-Debrid and TorBox"}
